From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:13:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: create debugfs flag files from a table

K3: retain each flag name, initial-value clamp, read/write limit and log message in one table and owned file vector. Share the bounded text and u32 readers. Keep MaintKnob separate so its strict 0/1 syntax and pre-store memory barrier do not change, and retain the joint cap validation. File ownership still precedes the directory in drop order.
